38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Asuka, 1,100 yen is cheap! But our own hall is booked, so we’d have to train at weird hours.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"The inland clubs slept eight to a room. Whole-building lets charge for everyone, even if they cancel.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
